WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 13]

01:39.180 --> 01:41.160
[Lushan Hall, Dihuo House]

01:41.160 --> 01:42.180
Violet Monkey Blossom.

01:43.870 --> 01:44.890
Celestial Essence Fruit.

01:46.590 --> 01:47.540
Jade Marrow Mushroom.

01:49.830 --> 01:51.140
Being born to a prestigious clan sure is a privilege.

01:52.230 --> 01:54.650
While Senior Chen failed to get anything in the Bloody Trial Ground,

01:55.160 --> 01:56.620
she nonetheless obtained two Foundation Pills

01:57.070 --> 01:58.300
thanks to her family.

01:59.600 --> 02:01.740
For those who were born to cultivate,

02:02.230 --> 02:03.420
two pills will probably suffice.

02:04.960 --> 02:06.460
But knowing my lack of talent,

02:07.030 --> 02:09.010
I need more than ten Foundation Pills

02:10.030 --> 02:11.090
to even stand a chance.

02:20.960 --> 02:21.730
It works!

02:24.840 --> 02:25.620
The quality is good too.

02:42.140 --> 02:45.100
♪That day I first saw you...♪

02:47.560 --> 02:48.330
Right.

02:50.420 --> 02:53.460
♪We made a promise to reunite♪

02:54.540 --> 02:57.540
♪And walked into the unknown♪

02:58.900 --> 03:01.860
♪But now that we've met again...♪

03:02.380 --> 03:05.460
♪Only silence fills the space as we lock eyes...♪

03:07.150 --> 03:08.210
Let me try two first.

03:10.900 --> 03:13.820
♪With no way to know when we'll return...♪

03:17.590 --> 03:18.380
These pills

03:18.710 --> 03:20.020
are too intense.

03:20.180 --> 03:23.660
♪So be it, I set myself free♪

03:24.300 --> 03:27.820
♪To be one who stands tall between heaven and earth♪

03:28.500 --> 03:32.020
♪Never let yourself become a hollow husk of what you once were♪

03:32.540 --> 03:36.060
♪The ones before once told me♪

03:36.540 --> 03:40.100
♪There's still hardship ahead...♪

03:40.480 --> 03:42.050
How long has it been?

03:44.740 --> 03:47.660
♪Even though it mocks loudly♪

03:48.500 --> 03:52.020
♪We're just fleeting mortals♪

03:52.660 --> 03:56.180
♪Time slipped by before we knew...♪

03:57.150 --> 03:58.610
I feel warm.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.690
Is it the residual effect from the pills?

04:00.780 --> 04:04.340
♪Into this starry sky♪

04:04.940 --> 04:08.460
♪Starlight fades into the Milky Way♪

04:09.140 --> 04:12.580
♪While the mayfly dies in the whirlpool...♪

04:14.310 --> 04:14.940
Again.

04:17.300 --> 04:20.860
♪Playing the fleeting game of life♪

04:21.420 --> 04:24.980
♪Each step of fate's game unclear...♪

04:28.030 --> 04:29.220
To build a foundation

04:30.360 --> 04:31.290
is to shed your skin,

04:32.520 --> 04:33.570
to rearrange your physique,

04:34.840 --> 04:35.850
and to condense qi into liquid.

04:37.860 --> 04:41.420
♪Through all the joy and sorrow♪

04:41.940 --> 04:45.540
♪How do I choose the way...♪

04:46.520 --> 04:48.570
This hurts so much!

06:12.950 --> 06:13.930
Yan Ruyan,

06:14.560 --> 06:16.290
I invested so much

06:16.390 --> 06:18.100
to achieve this.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.850
Don't you let me down now.

06:38.800 --> 06:39.290
Elder Liu.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.050
My Lord.

06:42.390 --> 06:43.140
You came at the right time.

06:43.800 --> 06:44.660
His technique

06:44.830 --> 06:46.490
works wonders on Yan.

06:46.800 --> 06:48.050
He said he could wake Yan up

06:48.360 --> 06:49.900
if I promised him one thing.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.660
What does he want?

06:52.950 --> 06:53.850
He wants Yan to be his wife.

06:54.040 --> 06:54.660
No.

06:54.830 --> 06:55.980
You cannot trust him,

06:56.270 --> 06:57.410
let alone let him marry your daughter.

06:57.950 --> 06:58.460
Elder Liu,

06:59.390 --> 07:00.220
what do you mean?

07:00.870 --> 07:01.930
You brought him here, didn't you?

07:06.040 --> 07:07.340
May we speak privately?

07:10.920 --> 07:11.980
I just saw

07:12.000 --> 07:13.290
the technique he used

07:13.360 --> 07:14.730
to heal Miss Yan.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.490
It is an evil art

07:16.800 --> 07:17.930
that absorbs others' power.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.250
Not only is it against nature,

07:20.360 --> 07:22.020
but it might bring about dire consequences too.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.850
Enough.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.410
I've always

07:24.720 --> 07:25.780
respected your advice,

07:26.120 --> 07:26.700
but this time,

07:26.950 --> 07:27.810
he's my only choice.

07:28.240 --> 07:29.460
My Lord!

07:30.870 --> 07:32.490
That man merely saw Young Lady once

07:32.510 --> 07:33.580
and decided to marry her.

07:33.750 --> 07:35.100
He's extorting you.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.780
I'm sure he wants more

07:36.800 --> 07:37.700
out of our clan.

07:37.870 --> 07:39.660
Please think twice, My Lord.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.170
Elder Liu,

07:47.920 --> 07:49.020
do you think I'm sacrificing

07:49.160 --> 07:50.610
our clan to save Yan?

07:51.750 --> 07:52.460
On the contrary,

07:53.480 --> 07:55.900
I'm trying to save our clan's future.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.340
What holds the Seven Sects together

07:58.870 --> 08:00.100
is not the disciples or various resources,

08:01.040 --> 08:03.340
but the elusive Nascent Soul Stage elders.

08:05.800 --> 08:06.930
Everything below the Nascent Soul Stage

08:07.720 --> 08:09.050
is as puny as ants.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.580
Yan is bestowed with the heavenly spirit root.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.020
She is the only one

08:16.480 --> 08:18.020
in our clan who can possibly attain the Nascent Soul Stage.

08:19.270 --> 08:20.980
She is our only hope

08:22.430 --> 08:24.490
to leverage against the Seven Sects.

08:27.120 --> 08:27.730
Elder Liu,

08:28.600 --> 08:29.220
surely

08:29.390 --> 08:30.170
you know about this.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.490
If you've made up your mind,

08:34.000 --> 08:35.050
there's no need for me to convince you otherwise.

08:35.750 --> 08:37.020
But please give me some time

08:37.680 --> 08:38.540
to investigate

08:38.750 --> 08:40.410
his background with others.

08:41.750 --> 08:43.370
Even commoners ask about the groom's family

08:44.040 --> 08:45.490
when they marry their daughters off.

08:48.600 --> 08:49.140
Fine.

08:50.360 --> 08:51.540
But Yan doesn't have much time.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.020
Make it quick.

08:54.390 --> 08:54.810
Understood.

09:24.920 --> 09:26.050
Elder Liu.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.660
What do you want exactly?

09:29.870 --> 09:30.850
This isn't what we agreed upon.

09:31.560 --> 09:33.410
What I want isn't important.

09:33.920 --> 09:35.810
What's important is

09:38.510 --> 09:38.900
how we do it.

09:41.430 --> 09:42.460
We had a deal.

09:43.040 --> 09:44.850
I put in good words for you in front of Lord Yan

09:45.510 --> 09:46.900
and you'll pay me 1,000 gems.

09:48.630 --> 09:49.140
You

09:49.390 --> 09:51.140
are so eager, aren't you?

09:52.680 --> 09:53.100
I...

09:54.360 --> 09:55.660
I just want to know

09:55.920 --> 09:56.730
where my gems are.

10:18.030 --> 10:19.100
Relax.

10:20.630 --> 10:23.340
The gems are ready.

10:26.750 --> 10:27.890
Now that I have the gems,

10:28.600 --> 10:29.530
we are even.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.180
I'll leave the Yan Clan Stronghold now.

10:32.510 --> 10:33.940
I have nothing to do

10:35.240 --> 10:35.820
with what you do here.

10:36.720 --> 10:37.490
Wait.

10:38.670 --> 10:40.130
Why the hurry?

10:43.790 --> 10:45.610
Are you going

10:47.750 --> 10:49.770
to snitch me out to the other sects?

11:23.080 --> 11:23.700
My Lord,

11:23.960 --> 11:25.130
Elder Liu hasn't returned after he left

11:25.360 --> 11:26.220
to meet the target.

11:26.720 --> 11:27.940
I fear the worst has happened.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.530
I see.

11:33.630 --> 11:34.220
You're dismissed.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.220
My Lord,

11:35.440 --> 11:35.980
should I...

11:36.080 --> 11:36.890
Just go.

11:46.150 --> 11:46.730
Come out already.

11:53.150 --> 11:54.610
Your reputation precedes you, Lord Yan.

11:55.510 --> 11:57.370
As expected of the only Core Formation Stage cultivator

11:57.390 --> 11:58.980
of your clan in the last century.

11:59.150 --> 12:00.580
Your spirit sense

12:01.240 --> 12:02.100
is impressive.

12:02.870 --> 12:03.530
Be it

12:03.750 --> 12:04.650
treating

12:05.120 --> 12:06.180
or betrothing Yan,

12:07.550 --> 12:09.010
they are just your pretexts.

12:10.390 --> 12:11.890
Tell me your real objective.

12:18.510 --> 12:19.530
Lord Yan,

12:20.550 --> 12:21.490
do you remember

12:22.630 --> 12:23.610
the promise centuries ago?

12:28.360 --> 12:28.820
Of course.

12:29.390 --> 12:30.730
Were it not for our shared past,

12:31.030 --> 12:31.610
do you think

12:33.720 --> 12:35.580
I would still keep you alive now?

12:39.150 --> 12:40.250
You sure are

12:40.510 --> 12:41.980
a sentimental person.

12:42.320 --> 12:43.180
In that case,

12:43.600 --> 12:45.650
why don't we continue our shared history

12:45.870 --> 12:46.770
so the Yan Clan

12:46.910 --> 12:48.610
can return to its rightful master?

12:48.910 --> 12:51.100
My father is thirsty for someone powerful

12:51.480 --> 12:52.770
like you.

12:54.240 --> 12:55.130
You must be joking.

12:56.240 --> 12:58.580
My clan has settled down in the Yue Kingdom.

12:59.030 --> 13:00.370
We left the Ghost Spirit Sect

13:00.910 --> 13:02.700
300 years ago,

13:04.080 --> 13:05.220
and we don't plan to return.

13:06.960 --> 13:08.940
You're mistaken, Lord Yan.

13:10.390 --> 13:11.980
What I mean is

13:14.000 --> 13:14.940
the Seven Sects

13:15.320 --> 13:17.460
have ruled the Yue Kingdom for long enough.

13:18.270 --> 13:20.060
My sect

13:20.320 --> 13:21.010
can help you

13:21.150 --> 13:22.850
become the future ruler of Yue.

13:24.150 --> 13:26.180
When that happens, you won't have to beg

13:26.600 --> 13:28.700
for one spirit herb.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.180
Truth be told,

13:35.720 --> 13:37.890
the Six Demonic Sects have rallied armies

13:38.270 --> 13:39.610
and will attack soon.

13:39.960 --> 13:41.370
The Seven Sects

13:41.840 --> 13:43.060
will turn into dust.

13:43.630 --> 13:44.940
Alas, the Yan Clan Stronghold

13:45.480 --> 13:46.490
is located on the border.

13:46.600 --> 13:47.890
It will feel the brunt of the invasion.

13:50.670 --> 13:52.460
What will become of it?

14:00.790 --> 14:01.980
The war hasn't begun.

14:02.720 --> 14:03.770
No one knows

14:04.030 --> 14:05.300
who the victor is yet.

14:10.150 --> 14:12.130
Isn't it arrogant of your father

14:12.870 --> 14:14.770
to ask me to take his side now?

14:16.440 --> 14:17.460
Besides,

14:17.870 --> 14:19.530
your father has sired many children.

14:20.150 --> 14:22.060
His sister, Hongfen, is still there.

14:22.600 --> 14:23.850
Do you truly have a say in regards

14:26.750 --> 14:28.650
to your sect's matters?

14:34.200 --> 14:35.100
Lord Yan,

14:36.750 --> 14:38.730
this is both my father's

14:39.200 --> 14:41.010
and my wish.

14:41.840 --> 14:42.420
Look.

14:53.000 --> 14:54.220
An exceptionally rare

14:55.080 --> 14:55.770
dark spirit root?

14:56.080 --> 14:56.650
Exactly.

15:01.750 --> 15:03.580
Your daughter is born with the heavenly spirit root.

15:03.960 --> 15:05.980
And I have the dark spirit root.

15:06.390 --> 15:09.180
We make the best pair to study the Blood Spirit Spell.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.770
And knowing her potential and mine,

15:14.320 --> 15:15.490
we're likely to attain

15:15.720 --> 15:18.650
the Nascent Soul Stage, let alone the Core Formation Stage.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.850
Imagine this.

15:23.960 --> 15:26.220
Your clan will have two Nascent Soul Stage cultivators.

15:26.480 --> 15:29.220
You will be stronger than the Seven Sects.

15:29.840 --> 15:30.460
Additionally...

15:34.120 --> 15:36.010
Additionally, I promise

15:36.480 --> 15:38.250
that our child

15:38.510 --> 15:40.820
will become the successor of both

15:40.960 --> 15:42.580
my sect and your clan.

15:58.200 --> 15:59.130
You come up

16:00.390 --> 16:02.460
with this plan yourself?

16:04.670 --> 16:05.580
I will

16:06.030 --> 16:07.820
take over my sect.

16:09.080 --> 16:10.010
But I

16:10.360 --> 16:11.250
need you as my ally,

16:11.360 --> 16:13.060
more so than my father

16:13.390 --> 16:15.490
or Aunt Hongfen.

16:17.270 --> 16:18.700
I ask for your

16:20.440 --> 16:21.370
cooperation.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.940
Will you swear

17:00.870 --> 17:02.770
a Truedeath Oath with me?

17:12.860 --> 17:15.820
[An isolation chamber in Yellow Maple Valley]

17:24.200 --> 17:24.980
Han Li.

17:25.750 --> 17:26.770
Could it be him?

17:34.240 --> 17:35.370
This is the last pill.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.250
I

17:43.750 --> 17:45.100
have to make this work.

17:50.080 --> 17:51.420
By swallowing this golden pill,

17:52.030 --> 17:53.770
I shall defy my predestined fate!

18:27.960 --> 18:28.530
Oh, no.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.700
If I don't put the extra power within me

18:31.030 --> 18:32.060
to use,

18:32.390 --> 18:33.530
my body will be overwhelmed.

18:36.630 --> 18:38.060
Qingyuan Sword Manual!

19:15.960 --> 19:16.810
Did I

19:17.350 --> 19:18.050
do it?

19:19.270 --> 19:20.570
I've also reached Tier 4

19:20.790 --> 19:22.010
of the Qingyuan Sword Manual.

19:23.160 --> 19:23.860
Despite

19:24.350 --> 19:25.490
my fake spirit root, I'm now in

19:26.310 --> 19:27.290
the Foundation Establishment Stage.

19:30.750 --> 19:32.010
One Foundation Pill left.

19:33.440 --> 19:34.330
Chen Qiaoqian,

19:35.000 --> 19:36.940
stop getting distracted.

19:38.000 --> 19:39.770
You can't let your family down again.

20:30.550 --> 20:31.250
I can't stand it anymore.

20:31.880 --> 20:32.770
- What's wrong? - What's the matter?

20:33.640 --> 20:34.620
I'm sick of it.

20:36.110 --> 20:36.770
I know.

20:37.000 --> 20:37.620
He's

20:37.680 --> 20:39.090
sick of you.

20:39.270 --> 20:39.860
Me?

20:40.030 --> 20:40.770
What did I do?

20:40.880 --> 20:43.010
All you do is stare at the sky

20:43.270 --> 20:44.460
in hopes that Xuan'er

20:44.590 --> 20:46.570
will appear.

20:47.000 --> 20:47.770
Pot calling

20:47.960 --> 20:48.660
the kettle black.

20:48.750 --> 20:49.860
You keep staring at Senior Liu too.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.530
No, I didn't.

20:56.310 --> 20:57.080
What's so good

20:57.080 --> 20:58.560
about dating anyway?

20:59.000 --> 20:59.900
You might as well

21:00.270 --> 21:01.330
use the time to cultivate.

21:03.070 --> 21:03.940
Look over there.

21:09.440 --> 21:10.860
It seems our sect has one more...

21:13.310 --> 21:13.730
No.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.530
Two more Foundation Establishment Stage cultivators.

21:16.640 --> 21:17.570
Wonderful!

21:20.920 --> 21:21.660
Mentor Xu.

21:22.830 --> 21:24.700
I saw a column of light here just now.

21:24.920 --> 21:26.380
Did someone reach the Foundation Establishment Stage as well?

21:26.440 --> 21:27.620
Han Li did it.

21:28.400 --> 21:29.220
Who

21:30.000 --> 21:31.460
would have thought?

21:33.400 --> 21:34.490
He and his fake spirit root

21:34.510 --> 21:35.460
have proved

21:35.480 --> 21:36.570
so many people wrong.

21:36.640 --> 21:37.660
Where is he now?

21:37.880 --> 21:38.900
He just left.

21:39.030 --> 21:40.490
You arrived a second too late.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.180
He is...

21:42.550 --> 21:45.290
You're just as impatient as he is.

21:51.830 --> 21:52.660
Han Li!

21:53.830 --> 21:54.940
Han.

21:56.110 --> 21:57.050
- Wait. - Senior Chen?

21:57.750 --> 21:58.420
Han.

21:58.830 --> 21:59.460
Congratulations.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.330
You have reached the Foundation Establishment Stage.

22:01.030 --> 22:01.940
Likewise.

22:05.070 --> 22:05.770
You

22:05.920 --> 22:07.460
saved me that day, didn't you?

22:08.400 --> 22:09.250
What do you mean?

22:10.000 --> 22:11.490
You killed Senior Lu

22:11.960 --> 22:13.180
before the Bloody Trial Ground.

22:15.310 --> 22:16.330
Quit joking around, Senior Chen.

22:16.920 --> 22:19.050
Senior Lu is an excellent Qi Refining Stage cultivator.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.730
I am not strong enough to kill him.

22:21.350 --> 22:21.900
But

22:21.920 --> 22:23.180
you escaped the dangerous

22:23.240 --> 22:24.460
Bloody Trial Ground unscathed.

22:24.880 --> 22:26.530
Grandmaster Li even took you in as his disciple.

22:27.720 --> 22:28.460
It was just a stroke of luck.

22:29.070 --> 22:29.860
I have things to do.

22:30.030 --> 22:30.620
Farewell.

22:32.720 --> 22:33.660
Why won't you admit

22:33.880 --> 22:35.180
that you saved me?

22:35.830 --> 22:37.220
I should have given her more Oblivion Pills.

22:42.270 --> 22:43.490
I know it was you

22:44.270 --> 22:45.250
even if you don't admit it.

22:55.480 --> 22:56.860
Can you feel it?

22:57.160 --> 22:57.900
Do you know

22:58.000 --> 22:59.250
I'm performing cupping on your back?

22:59.590 --> 23:00.900
It will remove the cold energy

23:00.920 --> 23:02.940
and the bad energy from you.

23:03.030 --> 23:05.730
All of it.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.380
You're not doing it properly.

23:07.680 --> 23:08.810
I don't think Han Li did this

23:08.830 --> 23:10.570
when he was helping me.

23:12.200 --> 23:13.090
If you're this good,

23:13.200 --> 23:14.140
do it yourself.

23:14.720 --> 23:15.570
If I can do it myself,

23:15.680 --> 23:16.530
I won't ask you for help.

23:21.000 --> 23:21.900
Mentor Ma.

23:27.440 --> 23:28.180
Mentor Wu.

23:29.550 --> 23:30.250
You've attained the Foundation Establishment Stage?

23:36.200 --> 23:37.700
Not too shabby.

23:37.750 --> 23:38.900
You've attained the Foundation Establishment Stage.

23:39.110 --> 23:40.140
Nice one.

23:41.640 --> 23:42.700
It's all thanks to you, Mentor Ma.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.250
I wouldn't have achieved what I did

23:44.270 --> 23:45.380
had you not let me

23:45.680 --> 23:46.900
tend to this garden.

23:49.920 --> 23:50.380
Then,

23:50.510 --> 23:51.490
you should

23:52.110 --> 23:53.530
address me differently now.

23:53.960 --> 23:54.730
Call me

23:54.960 --> 23:56.090
Senior Ma.

23:56.960 --> 23:58.470
Now that you're in the Foundation Establishment Stage,

23:58.680 --> 23:59.990
my garden is of no use

24:00.070 --> 24:01.380
to you.

24:03.880 --> 24:05.290
Pack up

24:05.480 --> 24:06.490
and find your master now.

24:09.960 --> 24:10.660
Go.

24:11.070 --> 24:12.250
Go now.

24:12.510 --> 24:13.220
Make haste.

24:45.940 --> 24:47.660
♪The ripples disappear into the river♪

24:48.260 --> 24:51.180
♪My robe is soaked under the drizzle♪

24:52.260 --> 24:56.940
♪I drink alone as the moonlight melts with the liquor♪

24:57.820 --> 25:00.100
♪The current flows swiftly, the mountains weigh heavily...♪

25:01.240 --> 25:02.460
They say you see things differently

25:03.000 --> 25:04.140
once you're in the Foundation Establishment Stage.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.290
But all I see

25:07.070 --> 25:08.460
are familiar scenes.

25:12.180 --> 25:13.900
♪The breeze brushes through the corridor♪

25:14.340 --> 25:17.380
♪As the swallows whisper overhead♪

25:18.460 --> 25:23.100
♪The setting sun graces the bamboo forest, for whom do I harmonize?♪

25:23.980 --> 25:26.220
♪Leaning against the rails, water ripples below me♪

25:27.060 --> 25:28.980
♪The wind whispers to the forest♪

25:30.500 --> 25:33.180
♪I wander into the dream under the clear galaxy...♪

25:33.200 --> 25:33.940
I won't forget you,

25:34.640 --> 25:35.810
Herbs Garden.

25:36.070 --> 25:37.530
Just go!

25:38.780 --> 25:40.780
♪This journey that spans across the universe♪

25:41.700 --> 25:43.460
♪Feels both familiar and unfamiliar♪

25:44.660 --> 25:49.660
♪Looking at the various faces of our world♪

25:50.700 --> 25:52.660
♪Each word, each utterance♪

25:53.580 --> 25:55.380
♪Carries the hopes of a lifetime...♪

25:57.510 --> 25:58.180
Come up.

26:02.750 --> 26:04.010
You can't bring

26:04.030 --> 26:04.810
those weary eyes of yours.

26:05.240 --> 26:07.010
Present yourself properly.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.010
Again.

26:15.640 --> 26:16.290
Come up.

26:22.590 --> 26:23.380
Greetings,

26:23.680 --> 26:24.460
I am Han Li.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.570
You're greeting your master.

26:26.590 --> 26:28.380
You have to kneel.

26:30.550 --> 26:31.220
Greetings,

26:31.400 --> 26:32.220
I am Han Li.

26:35.310 --> 26:36.860
All right. Get up.

26:37.440 --> 26:38.090
Thanks, Master.

26:40.880 --> 26:41.730
As per our tradition,

26:42.030 --> 26:42.960
before Master takes you in,

26:43.030 --> 26:44.900
I have to give you a test.

26:47.070 --> 26:48.290
I am but an average disciple.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.420
I ask

26:51.550 --> 26:52.660
for your leniency.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.090
Relax.

26:54.440 --> 26:55.290
It's just a simple test.

26:58.830 --> 27:00.380
If you can understand my flute notes,

27:00.680 --> 27:01.700
I consider you passed.

27:01.920 --> 27:02.700
Close your eyes.

27:14.200 --> 27:14.900
Open your eyes.

27:17.750 --> 27:18.770
What did you hear?

27:25.160 --> 27:26.090
Silence

27:26.270 --> 27:27.330
speaks louder than words.

27:28.310 --> 27:28.900
You passed.

27:29.350 --> 27:30.570
In the Foundation Establishment Stage,

27:31.000 --> 27:32.860
you will be able to sense the power in all beings.

27:33.310 --> 27:34.860
It's as if you have one more sense on top of your five senses.

27:35.510 --> 27:36.660
Do not forget this.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.810
Thank you, Senior.

27:40.880 --> 27:41.530
My turn now.

27:43.830 --> 27:45.380
Remove the bird's ability to fly

27:46.270 --> 27:47.620
without hurting it.

27:48.070 --> 27:48.940
Then, you'll pass.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.660
How kind of you, Senior.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.010
You wanted me to help you

28:08.510 --> 28:09.460
free a trapped bird, right?

28:12.480 --> 28:12.940
Yes.

28:13.720 --> 28:15.200
Since Senior Liu approves of you,

28:15.790 --> 28:16.660
I consider you passed.

28:17.440 --> 28:17.900
All right.

28:18.000 --> 28:18.530
It's my turn now.

28:20.510 --> 28:22.050
Dodge all three of my sand pouches.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.330
Then, you'll pass.

28:24.350 --> 28:24.980
Here I go.

28:31.160 --> 28:31.700
Good.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.010
You passed.

28:33.270 --> 28:34.010
Listen up.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.490
Cultivation is important.

28:35.590 --> 28:36.530
But don't forget

28:36.640 --> 28:37.460
to train your body as well.

28:37.750 --> 28:39.250
If you live a long life and don't move a lot,

28:39.550 --> 28:40.530
you're no different from a tortoise.

28:42.640 --> 28:43.380
It's my turn now.

28:53.200 --> 28:53.900
Enough, Wu Xuan.

28:54.030 --> 28:54.570
No.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.940
He's better than this.

29:08.480 --> 29:09.290
Tier 4?

29:11.200 --> 29:12.770
Upon reaching Tier 4 of the Qingyuan Sword Manual,

29:13.030 --> 29:14.570
you can guard against blades automatically.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.220
The manual states

29:16.440 --> 29:17.420
that

29:17.480 --> 29:18.220
when attacked,

29:18.480 --> 29:19.570
the shield will block any blades.

29:20.350 --> 29:22.460
You've reached Tier 4 of the manual?

29:23.750 --> 29:24.810
Don't you know you should

29:24.830 --> 29:26.090
stop at Tier 3?

29:27.030 --> 29:27.980
Did you feel something off

29:28.000 --> 29:29.220
when you were cultivating?

29:31.350 --> 29:32.290
My progress slows down

29:32.480 --> 29:33.380
a lot

29:33.640 --> 29:34.330
at Tier 4.

29:35.440 --> 29:36.490
After a while,

29:36.830 --> 29:38.010
the spirit power I gathered

29:38.400 --> 29:39.700
will slowly disappear.

29:40.070 --> 29:40.860
It's

29:41.110 --> 29:42.380
the dissipation.

29:43.880 --> 29:44.730
Dissipation?

29:45.680 --> 29:48.090
Upon reaching Tier 4 of the Qingyuan Sword Manual,

29:48.240 --> 29:48.980
your power dissipates

29:49.070 --> 29:50.620
every few days.

29:53.790 --> 29:55.220
But Master didn't tell me about this

29:55.240 --> 29:56.380
when he taught me.

29:57.640 --> 29:59.090
Calm down, Han.

29:59.750 --> 30:00.900
At Tier 4,

30:01.070 --> 30:02.660
only 1/10 of your power will dissipate.

30:03.030 --> 30:04.490
At Tier 5,

30:04.750 --> 30:06.380
another 1/10 of your power will dissipate.

30:07.480 --> 30:08.570
That's too much.

30:10.400 --> 30:11.660
I trained so hard to reach Tier 4

30:11.920 --> 30:13.290
just for it to backfire on me?

30:14.790 --> 30:16.220
It is a flawed

30:16.480 --> 30:17.770
but unique technique.

30:18.350 --> 30:20.380
I was told that each tier you reached

30:20.510 --> 30:21.980
would expand your Meridian system

30:22.160 --> 30:23.570
and deepen your energy pool.

30:23.880 --> 30:24.860
You will have

30:25.070 --> 30:26.330
much more power reserve

30:26.330 --> 30:27.140
than your peers.

30:27.640 --> 30:28.420
That's right.

30:28.720 --> 30:30.400
Perhaps this is why

30:30.400 --> 30:31.810
your power dissipates.

30:34.480 --> 30:35.180
Unfortunately,

30:35.270 --> 30:36.420
the manual we have is incomplete.

30:36.720 --> 30:39.180
The sect only possesses the first nine tiers of the manual.

30:44.550 --> 30:45.530
What do I do?

30:56.790 --> 30:57.220
Master.

30:57.350 --> 30:58.090
Han Li is here.

30:59.240 --> 30:59.730
He is?

31:00.920 --> 31:01.730
Right away.

31:01.830 --> 31:02.490
I'm coming.

31:03.720 --> 31:04.980
Give me a moment.

31:07.880 --> 31:08.460
Greetings,

31:08.590 --> 31:09.180
Master.

31:09.200 --> 31:10.050
Forget it.

31:10.750 --> 31:11.730
At ease.

31:11.920 --> 31:12.810
It's a hassle.

31:12.830 --> 31:13.900
Just get up.

31:15.720 --> 31:16.940
As cultivators,

31:17.000 --> 31:17.730
we seek simplicity.

31:19.160 --> 31:19.810
From now on,

31:20.550 --> 31:21.380
you

31:21.400 --> 31:23.250
are my disciple.

31:24.440 --> 31:25.420
Cultivate diligently

31:25.590 --> 31:26.570
from now on.

31:26.830 --> 31:28.700
Don't bring dishonor to my name.

31:29.640 --> 31:30.730
Yes, Master.

31:33.880 --> 31:35.220
You see, cultivation

31:37.030 --> 31:38.380
is a way to defy your destiny.

31:38.920 --> 31:39.980
Look at yourself.

31:40.640 --> 31:42.490
The Foundation Pill has transformed

31:42.720 --> 31:43.860
your body.

31:43.960 --> 31:45.860
You no longer possess a mortal body.

31:46.350 --> 31:48.010
But to go further,

31:49.160 --> 31:50.380
you must train your mind too

31:50.790 --> 31:51.380
in order

31:51.590 --> 31:53.330
to complete your internal and external transformation.

31:55.160 --> 31:56.380
Do enlighten me.

31:59.720 --> 32:00.700
Mortals

32:01.440 --> 32:02.810
have desires.

32:03.270 --> 32:04.140
Therefore,

32:04.640 --> 32:06.180
they have obsessions.

32:06.880 --> 32:08.420
When you are obsessed,

32:08.790 --> 32:10.380
it'll affect your progress.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.860
You'll hit a bottleneck

32:12.200 --> 32:13.250
as it turns into your inner demon.

32:13.920 --> 32:14.810
In serious cases,

32:14.960 --> 32:15.700
you might

32:16.000 --> 32:17.050
lose your progress

32:17.240 --> 32:18.810
or your life.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.810
Master, do you mean

32:22.880 --> 32:24.420
we should forsake our desires?

32:25.070 --> 32:26.140
Not at all.

32:27.070 --> 32:27.660
See?

32:27.960 --> 32:29.330
I knew you would think that way.

32:30.400 --> 32:31.090
You're wrong.

32:31.920 --> 32:32.980
Cultivation

32:33.160 --> 32:34.980
is about easement.

32:36.030 --> 32:38.570
To forsake all desires

32:38.680 --> 32:39.700
is to go against

32:39.790 --> 32:41.770
the purpose of cultivation.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.660
But

32:44.920 --> 32:46.770
true easement

32:47.030 --> 32:48.090
is hard to achieve.

32:48.590 --> 32:50.090
Therefore, I ask my disciples

32:50.110 --> 32:51.770
to accept all outcomes with grace.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.330
Accept your

32:53.480 --> 32:54.490
failures

32:54.640 --> 32:56.980
and you make peace with yourself.

32:57.680 --> 32:59.010
Make peace with yourself?

32:59.880 --> 33:01.420
This is very important.

33:01.440 --> 33:03.010
Make peace with yourself.

33:04.160 --> 33:06.220
Ask your seniors.

33:06.750 --> 33:09.010
I became the top Core Formation Stage cultivator

33:09.270 --> 33:09.940
in our sect

33:10.070 --> 33:11.770
thanks to this philosophy.

33:14.310 --> 33:15.980
Greetings, Grandmaster Hongfu.

33:17.920 --> 33:18.660
Hongfu.

33:20.550 --> 33:21.140
Well,

33:21.310 --> 33:22.180
I meant to say

33:22.200 --> 33:23.620
the top male Core Formation Stage cultivator.

33:24.400 --> 33:26.140
I need to borrow your master for some quick words.

33:26.440 --> 33:27.250
But carry on.

33:27.790 --> 33:28.530
I can wait.

33:28.750 --> 33:30.050
We're done.

33:31.310 --> 33:31.770
Han Li,

33:31.880 --> 33:34.090
you're now in the Foundation Establishment Stage.

33:34.200 --> 33:35.980
You can have your own cavern.

33:36.550 --> 33:38.180
Show him where to get

33:38.440 --> 33:39.700
the map to the back of the mountain

33:39.720 --> 33:40.980
as well as the array for the cavern.

33:41.440 --> 33:42.050
Go now.

33:42.550 --> 33:43.420
- Yes, Master. - Yes, Master.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.330
Hongfu,

33:45.640 --> 33:46.490
just some quick words?

33:47.440 --> 33:48.570
It could be more.

33:49.510 --> 33:50.010
Well,

33:50.240 --> 33:50.730
you...

33:50.750 --> 33:52.140
Farewell, Master.

33:52.440 --> 33:52.900
Go.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.420
Farewell, Grandmaster.

33:54.440 --> 33:55.660
You're so long-winded.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.490
Just go already.

33:56.920 --> 33:57.730
Farewell.

33:58.830 --> 34:00.140
That silly kid.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.090
Go ahead.

34:03.640 --> 34:05.220
The Clear Void Sect brought us some news.

34:05.790 --> 34:07.810
Fu Yunzi conducted an investigation for a year.

34:08.110 --> 34:09.980
He reported that half of the surviving

34:10.350 --> 34:11.180
disciples

34:11.510 --> 34:12.290
in the Trial Ground

34:12.510 --> 34:13.810
said that Spirit Beast Mountain was fishy.

34:17.350 --> 34:18.570
300 years ago, that sect

34:18.750 --> 34:19.570
split

34:19.590 --> 34:22.140
from the Beast Taming Sect of the Six Demonic Sects.

34:22.750 --> 34:24.050
It's not a stretch to think that they

34:24.070 --> 34:24.860
are consorting with the demonic sects.

34:26.070 --> 34:27.090
Remember who suggested

34:27.550 --> 34:29.810
that we changed the opening date of the Trial Ground?

34:30.110 --> 34:32.420
And who insisted that they knew where the demonic sects were?

34:32.750 --> 34:33.730
The Beast Taming Sect.

34:36.720 --> 34:38.050
I remember that.

34:38.590 --> 34:39.380
You know what?

34:39.480 --> 34:40.490
There's no use speculating.

34:41.880 --> 34:42.770
Bring them over

34:43.160 --> 34:44.180
and interrogate them.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.220
All right.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.050
I'll be leaving, then.

34:50.310 --> 34:50.980
You're leaving?

34:54.240 --> 34:55.290
So that's all.

34:58.070 --> 34:59.530
I rehearsed my greetings so many times

34:59.920 --> 35:01.460
only for it to end so abruptly.

35:02.790 --> 35:04.490
Can I trust this master of mine?

35:05.510 --> 35:06.490
He doesn't

35:06.920 --> 35:08.220
look like someone enlightened.

35:09.310 --> 35:10.730
Making peace with yourself.

35:11.680 --> 35:12.570
What does

35:13.070 --> 35:14.220
that even mean?

35:20.350 --> 35:21.140
Han,

35:21.680 --> 35:22.570
stop ruminating.

35:23.310 --> 35:25.010
Making peace with yourself

35:25.350 --> 35:27.140
is not something you get by thinking very hard about it.

35:30.790 --> 35:32.490
Master was very cryptic about it.

35:34.590 --> 35:36.050
Would you care to explain to me?

35:37.400 --> 35:38.660
Obsessions can be huge or small.

35:39.200 --> 35:41.010
We want different things,

35:41.350 --> 35:42.490
so we each

35:42.720 --> 35:43.860
have different obsessions.

35:45.840 --> 35:46.690
Oh.

35:47.440 --> 35:49.050
For Senior Liu,

35:49.400 --> 35:50.300
his obsession

35:50.510 --> 35:51.900
is to kill all evil perpetrators.

35:53.030 --> 35:54.260
Wu Xuan's obsession

35:54.280 --> 35:55.420
is Xuan'er.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.940
Weiniang's obsession

35:57.000 --> 35:57.740
is...

35:58.230 --> 35:59.050
Shut your mouth.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.130
My obsession

36:04.590 --> 36:05.900
is to have a real fight with you.

36:06.670 --> 36:07.340
Senior Song,

36:07.630 --> 36:08.420
you know I can't defeat you.

36:09.400 --> 36:10.610
Work hard then.

36:11.400 --> 36:12.210
I'll be waiting.

36:14.150 --> 36:15.340
Han,

36:15.880 --> 36:17.490
there's no need to obsess over it.

36:17.960 --> 36:19.780
Making peace with yourself

36:20.030 --> 36:21.050
is easier said than done.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.610
Look at our master.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.090
Grandmaster Hongfu came and was like,

36:27.000 --> 36:28.460
"I need to borrow your master for some quick words."

36:30.510 --> 36:31.420
Just some quick words?

36:31.840 --> 36:32.820
You silly kid.

36:33.070 --> 36:33.860
You're so long-winded.

36:34.070 --> 36:34.940
Just go already.

36:36.550 --> 36:37.820
Just go!

36:37.840 --> 36:38.420
We're talking about you.

36:38.440 --> 36:40.130
You weren't aware?

36:46.800 --> 36:47.260
If you get

36:47.800 --> 36:50.090
easily distracted in your progress,

36:51.000 --> 36:52.820
how can you achieve true peace?

38:03.300 --> 38:06.220
[Nangong Wan, Early Core Formation Stage]

38:09.670 --> 38:10.380
Congratulations,

38:10.510 --> 38:11.340
Wan.

38:11.800 --> 38:13.340
You have returned to the Core Formation Stage.

38:14.590 --> 38:16.300
I've nonetheless lost a lot of progress.

38:18.000 --> 38:19.130
It's all that fool's fault.

38:19.710 --> 38:20.570
Who?

38:23.030 --> 38:23.980
I was asking

38:24.590 --> 38:26.130
if our disciples

38:26.480 --> 38:28.050
have been cultivating properly or not.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.170
Wan,

38:32.270 --> 38:34.450
I've had a feeling that something is on your mind after you left

38:34.550 --> 38:35.610
the Bloody Trial Ground.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.130
Tell me already.

38:37.550 --> 38:38.420
What exactly

38:38.960 --> 38:40.090
happened there?

38:41.070 --> 38:41.980
My name is Han Li.

38:43.630 --> 38:44.260
Shoo.

38:45.590 --> 38:46.210
Shoo?

38:47.070 --> 38:47.820
No.

38:48.360 --> 38:49.090
I mean the sun.

38:49.710 --> 38:51.050
The sun

38:51.630 --> 38:52.530
is bright today.

38:53.440 --> 38:54.300
You...

38:55.440 --> 38:56.900
Since you care so much about our sect,

38:57.630 --> 38:58.610
do tend

38:58.800 --> 39:00.490
to those pending tasks accumulated while you were cultivating in solitude.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.050
You just returned to the Core Formation Stage.

39:03.190 --> 39:04.570
Your mind is still clamoring.

39:05.150 --> 39:06.780
We don't want any inner demon now, do we?

39:08.550 --> 39:09.260
Anyway,

39:10.480 --> 39:11.980
I was expecting you.

39:18.590 --> 39:19.690
Thanks to the Green Vial,

39:20.190 --> 39:21.490
I have an abundance of pills.

39:22.150 --> 39:24.460
But the dissipation of my power is an issue.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.210
They also said I could have my own cavern.

39:28.000 --> 39:29.300
How do I do that?

39:31.440 --> 39:32.740
Perhaps I should ask Mentor Wu.

39:42.920 --> 39:43.900
I'm so pissed.

39:44.480 --> 39:45.340
If I don't

39:45.710 --> 39:46.780
get rid of Han Li,

39:47.000 --> 39:48.490
I'll have an inner demon sooner or later.

39:49.000 --> 39:49.650
Grandmaster.

39:50.840 --> 39:51.530
Yes?

39:52.920 --> 39:54.340
Yellow Maple Valley sent us a jade scroll.

39:54.550 --> 39:55.610
Cultivator Li Huayuan

39:55.630 --> 39:57.090
invites all Core Formation Stage cultivators

39:57.280 --> 39:58.420
of the Seven Sects to discuss a strategy.

40:00.880 --> 40:01.420
Got it.

40:07.110 --> 40:08.460
What strategy?

40:09.960 --> 40:11.780
He just wants someone to play mahjong with him.

40:14.670 --> 40:16.610
But I do like the food there.

40:19.360 --> 40:20.170
All right.

40:20.590 --> 40:21.460
This can be my excuse.

40:21.670 --> 40:23.170
My senior can't stop me.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.090
And it's not about the food too.

40:28.320 --> 40:28.980
I can

40:29.190 --> 40:30.210
use this visit

40:30.590 --> 40:32.260
to check if that he told anyone or not.

40:32.710 --> 40:33.980
If he did,

40:34.360 --> 40:35.690
I'd make him pay.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.210
I need to kill him sooner or later.

40:55.630 --> 40:56.170
Mentor Wu.

40:58.760 --> 40:59.300
Mentor Wu.

41:02.480 --> 41:04.300
Just call me Senior Wu.

41:04.630 --> 41:05.530
I'm used to it already.

41:06.190 --> 41:07.210
You taught me so many things

41:07.280 --> 41:08.300
when I first came here.

41:09.000 --> 41:09.900
If you hadn't done that,

41:10.190 --> 41:12.090
I wouldn't have been able to enter the Bloody Trial Ground.

41:12.710 --> 41:13.340
Allow me to keep this appellation,

41:13.760 --> 41:14.340
Mentor Wu.

41:15.320 --> 41:16.530
It doesn't matter anyway.

41:19.000 --> 41:20.460
I saw you studying mugwort therapy

41:20.670 --> 41:21.820
in Herbs Garden last time.

41:22.670 --> 41:23.490
These two vials

41:23.590 --> 41:24.530
can help reduce the foul energy on you.

41:24.710 --> 41:25.530
It's more convenient too.

41:25.920 --> 41:26.650
Just let me know

41:26.840 --> 41:27.690
if you want

41:27.840 --> 41:28.780
to steam some mugwort.

41:30.400 --> 41:31.170
Thanks.

41:31.800 --> 41:33.050
It's very considerate of you.

41:34.480 --> 41:35.010
Oh.

41:35.760 --> 41:37.690
Have you found a place

41:37.800 --> 41:38.740
for your cavern?

41:39.320 --> 41:40.340
The array we distribute

41:40.550 --> 41:41.570
barely suffice.

41:42.030 --> 41:43.210
You need to pull

41:43.480 --> 41:44.300
some tricks.

41:46.190 --> 41:47.210
That said, I can't help you

41:47.550 --> 41:48.780
in this regard.

41:49.510 --> 41:50.340
Head to Treasure House

41:50.550 --> 41:51.380
to find a spirit beast.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.530
A spirit beast?

41:52.920 --> 41:53.740
It can help you.

42:12.760 --> 42:14.420
Wise choice, Mr. Li.

42:15.150 --> 42:15.940
This is

42:16.480 --> 42:19.170
a Treasure-Hunting Mouse that reached Grade 2 recently.

42:19.670 --> 42:21.780
It can find herbs, steal gems,

42:22.030 --> 42:23.170
and even locate a secret realm.

42:23.670 --> 42:24.610
Locate a secret realm?

42:29.920 --> 42:30.820
How much for it?

42:31.590 --> 42:32.130
A lot.

42:42.760 --> 42:43.340
I'll take it.

42:45.670 --> 42:46.170
Come.

42:49.440 --> 42:50.300
This is a lot.

43:06.420 --> 43:11.740
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:12.980 --> 43:18.380
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:18.500 --> 43:21.700
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:21.940 --> 43:24.180
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:24.580 --> 43:27.420
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:27.940 --> 43:31.900
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:32.740 --> 43:38.220
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:39.380 --> 43:44.660
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:45.260 --> 43:48.300
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:48.580 --> 43:50.700
♪Swept away by time♪

43:51.340 --> 43:53.980
♪Eyes once looked far♪

43:54.460 --> 43:58.420
♪Now lost in the shift♪

43:58.900 --> 44:01.740
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:02.020 --> 44:03.940
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:04.380 --> 44:06.820
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:07.140 --> 44:10.660
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:11.220 --> 44:14.180
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:14.500 --> 44:17.420
♪Time lost its name♪

44:17.820 --> 44:20.660
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:21.060 --> 44:24.620
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:24.980 --> 44:27.820
♪The world has changed♪

44:28.220 --> 44:30.060
♪Beyond recall♪

44:30.620 --> 44:32.340
♪Time will fade♪

44:32.740 --> 44:37.540
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:38.220 --> 44:41.100
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:41.580 --> 44:46.860
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:47.980 --> 44:54.620
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:55.100 --> 45:04.820
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
